# ALLOWLIST. This working directory accumulates things that must never be
# published: the ROM input, extracted/derived game assets, rendered frame
# dumps, recordings and build output. Only
# source, scripts and docs are tracked -- everything else is ignored by the
# leading "*" and has to be re-included explicitly below.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!build_miyoo.sh
!README_MIYOO.md
!course_sweep.sh
!dev.sh
!soak.sh
!bitexact_sweep.sh
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile
!miyoo/
!miyoo/game.json
!miyoo/icon_release.png
!miyoo/icon_release.svg
!miyoo/templates/
!miyoo/templates/*
!miyoo/tools/
!miyoo/tools/*.py
!tools/
!tools/*.py
!tools/*.sh
# The port itself (subtree of beckerd/psp_mk64_portable + our port
# branch). base-psp/.gitignore keeps assets, baserom, build/ out.
!base-psp/
!base-psp/**
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.mp4
*.log
*.core
!.gitmodules

# the Miyoo64 repository's docs
!SETTINGS.md
